66:revision:4","quote":"试验干预：SMOKE-r2-1（SGC-R21）为口服sGC激动剂；在GDMT基础上低剂量2.5mg、高剂量5mg每日一次，治疗12周","quote_sha256":"675224c4b7848949c73d83ff4721d9ee069f584125a14dc131716f7f59825aea","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_drug_info"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"特别关注的不良事件：TEAE发生率与严重程度（MedDRA 27.0）；第0、4、12周体位性低血压与收缩压变化","quote_sha256":"f308c4e2dc4f61c3f077cae43d91833eb183f9081fb2e6e4e527401832a77780","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_teae_safety"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"特别关注的不良事件：TEAE发生率与严重程度（MedDRA 27.0）；第0、4、12周体位性低血压与收缩压变化","quote_sha256":"f308c4e2dc4f61c3f077cae43d91833eb183f9081fb2e6e4e527401832a77780","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_sbp_safety"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"安全性终点：第12周6分钟步行距离较基线变化","quote_sha256":"deb2625f8c922a57be11b498fa95e3cb111bfc22077ea36c08d1c7972f5e0353","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_6mwd_endpoint"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（最长14天）；双盲治疗期（12周）；安全性随访期（末次给药后14天）","quote_sha256":"07ee676da9169ff7bd8873a4eb194a9fea3f97590a5af13071efd2a7848b5a32","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"es_safety_followup"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_study_design","es_drug_info","es_teae_safety","es_sbp_safety","es_6mwd_endpoint","es_safety_followup"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充AE/SAE/SUSAR定义、报告时限、报告对象及安全性评估窗口起止时点","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_safety_overview_def","missing_source_classes":["安全性管理计划","AE/SAE/SUSAR定义与报告规程"],"target":"8.1 总则"},{"action":"补充sGC激动剂类药物已知药理风险及特别监测要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_sgc_risk","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册"],"target":"8.1 总则"}],"heading":"总则","missing_source_classes":["安全性管理计划","AE/SAE/SUSAR定义与报告规程","研究者手册"],"proposal_text":"本研究为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索设计，试验药物SMOKE-r2-1（SGC-R21）为口服sGC激动剂，在标准心衰治疗（GDMT）基础上以2.5mg或5mg每日一次给药，治疗12周。安全性评价旨在系统收集和分析治疗期间及末次给药后14天安全性随访期内发生的不良事件，重点关注体位性低血压与收缩压变化趋势，同时评估第12周6分钟步行距离较基线变化作为功能性安全性指标。不良事件按MedDRA 27.0版本编码，按发生率与严重程度进行描述性统计。","rationale":"研究设计、药物信息、给药方案、安全性随访期、体位性低血压与收缩压评估、6分钟步行距离安全性终点及MedDRA 27.0编码均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。AE/SAE/SUSAR具体定义、报告时限、报告对象、安全性评估窗口起止时点及sGC激动剂类药物的已知药理风险监测要求未在允许来源中明确，需结合研究者手册和项目安全性管理计划确认。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d111357b42_94466dff1d49dc5b","section_number":"8.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:9a2a5f124182f77ff34b4927","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"c91bc90fdaceb83dbfde481b92ec59140cd8250cceafdbcd970f8b5c6795de22","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_d1d111357b42_cb40af386f90d99b:full-draft:9a2a5f124182f77ff34b4927","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:9a2a5f124182f77ff34b4927","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:3b2e251e11bb8cba8063752ef5c824857036f2d4a6568821606758be43b3b1f2:9a2a5f124182f77ff34b4927","text_sha256":"c91bc90fdaceb83dbfde481b92ec59140cd8250cceafdbcd970f8b5c6795de22"},{"content_sha256":"e49aa119fa79fb97c9ada834451eb7ccce1aae054f2913549c0f6b2070265bec","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","source_type":